## 6. Portfolio Reflection

This project demonstrates the responsible use of artificial intelligence in academic research. While AI efficiently summarized multiple sources, it also produced occasional factual inaccuracies and unsupported claims. Through systematic verification against official government reports and primary references, these issues were identified and corrected before inclusion in the final literature review. This experience highlights the importance of combining AI-assisted research with critical human evaluation to produce reliable, evidence-based policy recommendations for Mindanao's agricultural development.
